{"by": "opus", "k": "23c50fb4daaa1445", "note": "", "ru": "Пойдём домой, Масиро.", "st": "draft"}
{"by": "opus", "k": "9c83d9037fbdcfb5", "note": "", "ru": "…Да.", "st": "draft"}
